{"id":"426307","name":"豆腐鱼头汤","author":"企茶点茶档","authorId":"11132809","desc":"","cover":"images/426307/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼头","amount":"半个"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"半砖"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"预备材料。","img":"images/426307/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"不放油，前后干煎一分钟，直到表面没有血流。","img":"images/426307/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煎好后，再放点油，姜片，等油热了。","img":"images/426307/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放鱼头翻煎。","img":"images/426307/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎得半熟，放开水。","img":"images/426307/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"等水煮得奶白色。","img":"images/426307/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"再放豆腐。","img":"images/426307/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大火煮开了，转中火，最后上碟前放入香菜葱段，滚一下。","img":"images/426307/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上碟了。","img":"images/426307/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}